      "statement": "Dadas as matrizes $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}$ e $B = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$, calcule $A \\times B$.",
